    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In December 2019, the Aga Khan University organised a conference on Gender Equity and Women in Leadership. Hosted with the support of the University's Provost and Vice-President (Academic), Dr Carl Amrhein, the conference brought together change-makers in the fields of business, development, health, law and publishing to discuss the global challenges to achieving gender equity in the workplace, with a particular focus on Pakistan, and strategies to overcome these and enable more women to reach leadership positions.",
